der-style: solid; max-width: 280px; margin: 16px 0 10px;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 28px; padding=
-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Today=E2=80=99s key events</str=
